<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<title>The Dive – Portfolio of Muhammad Zayaam</title>
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Bagel+Fat+One&family=DM+Sans:wght@400;600&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
:root{--abyss:#000;--teal:#fff;--coral:#ffc20e;--gold:#ffc20e;--lilac:#e8e8e8;--depth:0}
*{box-sizing:border-box;margin:0}
html,body{height:100%;overflow:hidden}
body{font-family:'DM Sans',sans-serif;color:#eafcff;background:linear-gradient(180deg,#4a4a4a 0%,#2e2e2e 25%,#1a1a1a 50%,#0a0a0a 75%,#000 100%);background-size:100% 400%;background-position:0 calc(var(--depth)*1%);transition:background-position 1.6s ease}
h1,h2{font-family:'Bagel Fat One',cursive;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:.02em}
.rays{position:fixed;inset:0;pointer-events:none;background:repeating-linear-gradient(100deg,transparent 0 80px,rgba(255,194,14,.08) 80px 120px);animation:sway 9s ease-in-out infinite alternate;opacity:calc(1 - var(--depth)/90)}
@keyframes sway{from{transform:translateX(-40px)}to{transform:translateX(40px)}}
.view{position:fixed;inset:0;display:none;padding:24px;overflow-y:auto}
.view.on{display:block}
/* Home */
#home{display:none;place-items:center;text-align:center}
#home.on{display:grid}
.porthole{width:min(60vw,260px);aspect-ratio:1;border-radius:50%;border:12px solid var(--gold);box-shadow:0 0 0 6px #000,0 0 0 10px #fff,0 0 60px rgba(255,194,14,.6);overflow:hidden;background:var(--abyss);margin:0 auto 14px;animation:bob 4s ease-in-out infinite}
.porthole img{width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;display:block}
@keyframes bob{50%{transform:translateY(-12px)}}
h1{font-size:clamp(2rem,8vw,3.6rem);color:var(--gold)}
.sub{opacity:.9;margin-top:4px}
/* Bubbles */
.bubble{position:absolute;width:var(--s);height:var(--s);border-radius:50%;border:2px solid var(--gold);background:radial-gradient(circle at 30% 28%,rgba(255,194,14,.55),rgba(255,194,14,.06) 60%);color:#fff;font:600 .85rem 'DM Sans';cursor:pointer;display:grid;place-items:center;text-align:center;padding:8px;animation:rise var(--d) linear infinite;animation-delay:var(--w);left:var(--x);bottom:-130px;transition:transform .2s}
.bubble:hover,.bubble:focus-visible{transform:scale(1.15);outline:3px solid var(--gold)}
.bubble.pop{animation:pop .4s forwards}
@keyframes rise{to{bottom:105%}}
@keyframes pop{to{transform:scale(2);opacity:0}}
/* Depth panels */
.panel{max-width:560px;margin:8vh auto 0;padding:24px;border-radius:28px;background:rgba(0,0,0,.78);border:3px solid var(--c);box-shadow:8px 8px 0 var(--c);animation:sink .8s ease both}
@keyframes sink{from{transform:translateY(-60px);opacity:0}}
.panel h2{color:var(--c);font-size:2rem;margin-bottom:8px}
.panel p,.panel li{line-height:1.6;margin-bottom:8px}
.panel ul{padding-left:20px}
.depth{font-size:.85rem;color:var(--c);margin-bottom:4px}
.up{position:relative;display:inline-grid;margin-top:16px;width:92px;height:92px;border-radius:50%;border:2px solid #fff;background:radial-gradient(circle at 30% 28%,rgba(255,255,255,.5),rgba(255,255,255,.05));color:#fff;font:600 .85rem 'DM Sans';cursor:pointer;place-items:center;animation:bob 3s ease-in-out infinite}
.up:focus-visible{outline:3px solid var(--gold)}
.fish{filter:grayscale(1) brightness(1.6);position:fixed;top:55%;left:-120px;font-size:2.4rem;animation:swim 22s linear infinite;pointer-events:none}
@keyframes swim{to{left:110%}}
@media (prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){*{animation-duration:.01s!important;animation-iteration-count:1!important}.bubble{bottom:auto;top:calc(var(--n)*22vh + 6vh)}}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="rays"></div>
<div class="fish" aria-hidden="true">🐟</div>

<main>
<section id="home" class="view on">
  <div>
    <div class="porthole"><img src="data:image/jpeg;base64," alt="Portrait of Muhammad Zayaam"></div>
    <h1>Muhammad Zayaam</h1>
    <p class="sub">Pop a bubble to dive deeper.</p>
    <p class="sub" style="max-width:420px;margin:14px auto 0;font-size:.9rem">This site is an ocean dive instead of a menu: each bubble that floats past is a doorway, and every page sits at a deeper depth. Nothing is listed or ruled up; you have to catch what interests you. It is unconventional because the way you move through the site is the story of descending into who I am.</p>
  </div>
  <button class="bubble" style="--s:96px;--x:8%;--d:13s;--w:0s;--n:0" data-go="about">About me<br>30 m</button>
  <button class="bubble" style="--s:104px;--x:72%;--d:16s;--w:-4s;--n:1" data-go="wins">Wins<br>60 m</button>
  <button class="bubble" style="--s:100px;--x:30%;--d:19s;--w:-9s;--n:2" data-go="dreams">Dreams<br>90 m</button>
</section>

<section id="about" class="view" data-depth="30">
  <div class="panel" style="--c:var(--teal)">
    <div class="depth">30 m below the surface</div>
    <h2>About me</h2>
    <p>Hi, I'm Muhammad Zayaam, a computer science student at Heuser College. I like turning ideas into things people can click, play with and learn from, and I'm learning to build faster by working with AI and coding agents.</p>
    <p>I enjoy solving problems step by step, testing every change in the browser, and making designs that don't look like everyone else's.</p>
    <p>Fun fact: this whole site is a dive because I wanted the navigation to feel like exploring, not scrolling a list.</p>
    <button class="up" data-go="home">Back to surface</button>
  </div>
</section>

<section id="wins" class="view" data-depth="60">
  <div class="panel" style="--c:var(--coral)">
    <div class="depth">60 m below the surface</div>
    <h2>Personal wins</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>Started my computer science degree at Heuser College and kept building real projects alongside classes.</li>
      <li>Built and hosted my first websites on GitHub Pages, including this one.</li>
      <li>Learned to use Git, HTML, CSS and JavaScript, and to direct an AI coding agent while still understanding every line.</li>
      <li>Stayed consistent: showing up, practicing and finishing what I start.</li>
    </ul>
    <button class="up" data-go="home">Back to surface</button>
  </div>
</section>

<section id="dreams" class="view" data-depth="90">
  <div class="panel" style="--c:var(--lilac)">
    <div class="depth">90 m below the surface</div>
    <h2>What I want to create</h2>
    <p>I want to create useful, creative software: apps that make everyday life easier, interactive web experiences, and games that surprise people. Long term, I want to become a software engineer who builds products used by many people and who keeps learning new tools, including AI, to build them better.</p>
    <button class="up" data-go="home">Back to surface</button>
  </div>
</section>
</main>

<script>
const root=document.documentElement;
function go(id){
  document.querySelectorAll('.view').forEach(v=>v.classList.remove('on'));
  const v=document.getElementById(id);
  v.classList.add('on');
  root.style.setProperty('--depth',v.dataset.depth||0);
  v.scrollTop=0;
}
document.addEventListener('click',e=>{
  const b=e.target.closest('[data-go]');
  if(!b)return;
  if(b.classList.contains('bubble')){b.classList.add('pop');setTimeout(()=>{go(b.dataset.go);b.classList.remove('pop')},350)}
  else go(b.dataset.go);
});
</script>
</body>
</html>
